/**
@dir bmqeval

@brief The `BMQEVAL` (BlazingMQ Expression Evaluator) package provides a
mechanism for evaluating subscription expressions.

The `bmqeval` package provides a mechanism for validating, compiling, and
evaluating subscription expressions.  Such an expression is a simple logical
expression over a message's named properties, evaluated against each message to
determine whether it should be delivered to a consumer.
*/
